                                "sense_id": "dd1fbcd2-2b44-311a-8753-2044c2ecc62e",
                                "text": "Therfor Sathan [...] smoot Joob with a ful wickid botche fro the sole of the foot til to his top; which Joob schauyde the quytere with a schelle, and sat in the dunghil."
